* Netlist for given schematic

* NMOS Transistors
M1 2 5 2 2 NMOS  * Q1 (Drain, Gate, Source, Body)
M2 6 2 3 3 NMOS  * Q2 (Drain, Gate, Source, Body)

* Current Sources
I1 4 5 DC ii  * Current source providing current into net 5

* Voltage Sources
V1 4 2 DC  * Voltage source connected to net 4 and 2 (gate of Q1)
V2 6 2 DC  * Voltage source connected to net 6 and 2 (gate of Q2)

* Voltage References
Vdd 1 0 DC  * Supply voltage
GND 3 0  * Ground reference

* End of netlist